Date: Fri, 24 Oct 2025 10:58:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 067/913] dts: stm32mp25: define scmi regulator consumer

Define voltage regulator exposed by the SCMI server using the device
tree compatible node st,scmi-regulator-consumer for STM32MP25 and
STM32MP23 platforms.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 5af2b41346a47dabd3f8ac733cf9c0c1cf1367f2 dts: stm32mp25: define scmi regulator consumer]
Change-Id: I33f101ff958006e7fce67945b1109c1bc3fcfe1b
---
 .../regulator/st,stm32mp25-regulator.h        | 55 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 55 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 core/include/dt-bindings/regulator/st,stm32mp25-regulator.h

diff --git a/core/include/dt-bindings/regulator/st,stm32mp25-regulator.h b/core/include/dt-bindings/regulator/st,stm32mp25-regulator.h
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..ff4b60a96
--- /dev/null
+++ b/core/include/dt-bindings/regulator/st,stm32mp25-regulator.h
